1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,780
Dunyodagi eng qudratli siyosatchilardan biri.

2
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:07,060
Uning qarorlari millionlab insonlarning hayotiga ta’sir qiladi.

3
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:11,149
Uning uchrashuvlari, nutqlari va hatto oddiy bir harakati ham

4
00:00:11,149 --> 00:00:12,980
xalqaro yangilikka aylanadi.

5
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:17,138
Ammo Vladimir Putinning hayotida shunday bir soha bor-ki, u

6
00:00:17,138 --> 00:00:19,120
haqda Kreml juda kam gapiradi.

7
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:21,680
Bu — uning shaxsiy hayoti.

8
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:23,560
Putin kim bilan yashaydi?

9
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:27,464
Nega uning sobiq rafiqasi bilan ajrashgani uzoq yillar davomida

10
00:00:27,464 --> 00:00:28,480
muhokama qilindi?

11
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:32,810
Rossiyaning eng mashhur gimnastikachilaridan biri Alina Kabayeva

12
00:00:32,810 --> 00:00:36,260
nega doim uning ismi bilan yonma-yon tilga olinadi?

13
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:40,068
Va eng muhimi, jurnalistlar Putinning yashirin farzandlari

14
00:00:40,068 --> 00:00:42,340
haqida qanday ma’lumotlarni aniqlagan?

15
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:46,835
Bugun biz Vladimir Putinning ommaga ma’lum oilasi, jurnalistik

16
00:00:46,835 --> 00:00:49,480
surishtiruvlarda tilga olingan ayollar

17
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:53,540
va Kreml izoh berishni istamaydigan savollar haqida gaplashamiz.

18
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,480
Bu yerda rasmiy faktlar ham,

19
00:00:56,480 --> 00:01:00,101
jurnalistlarning tekshirilgan materiallari ham, hali mustaqil

20
00:01:00,101 --> 00:01:02,000
tasdiqlanmagan da’volar ham bor.

21
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:04,520
Ularning farqini ajratish juda muhim.

22
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:08,747
Chunki ba’zan eng katta sir odamlar nimani bilishida emas,

23
00:01:08,747 --> 00:01:10,700
nimani aniq bilmasligidadir.

24
00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:14,620
Birinchi sir: Putinning rasmiy oilasi.

25
00:01:15,820 --> 00:01:20,220
Vladimir Putin 1983-yilda Lyudmila Shkrebnevaga uylangan.

26
00:01:20,420 --> 00:01:23,680
U paytda u hali dunyoga mashhur siyosatchi emas edi.

27
00:01:23,680 --> 00:01:27,400
Sovet davlat xavfsizlik tizimida ishlayotgan yosh xodim edi.

28
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:29,820
Ularning oilasida ikki qiz tug‘ildi:

29
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:31,580
Mariya va Yekaterina.

30
00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:35,860
Keyinchalik Putin Rossiyaning eng yuqori lavozimiga ko‘tarildi.

31
00:01:36,140 --> 00:01:40,480
Ammo uning oilasi ommaviy axborot vositalaridan tobora uzoqlashdi.

32
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:44,643
Putin prezident sifatida ko‘plab tadbirlarda qatnashardi, lekin

33
00:01:44,643 --> 00:01:46,840
uning farzandlari deyarli ko‘rinmasdi.

34
00:01:47,340 --> 00:01:51,660
Bu holat jurnalistlar va jamoatchilikda ko‘plab savollar tug‘dirgan.

35
00:01:51,780 --> 00:01:53,420
2013-yil.

36
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:56,180
Iyun oyida esa kutilmagan voqea yuz berdi.

37
00:01:56,600 --> 00:02:00,940
Vladimir Putin va Lyudmila Putina ajrashayotganini omma oldida ma’lum qildi.

38
00:02:01,410 --> 00:02:03,980
Ular bu qarorni birgalikda qabul qilganini bildirishdi.

39
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:06,920
O‘ttiz yil davom etgan nikoh yakunlandi.

40
00:02:07,160 --> 00:02:11,100
Ammo ajrashuvdan keyin Putinning shaxsiy hayoti haqida savollar kamaymadi.

41
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:12,880
Aksincha, yanada ko‘paydi.

42
00:02:13,470 --> 00:02:16,573
Chunki aynan shu davrda Rossiyaning taniqli sportchisi bilan

43
00:02:16,573 --> 00:02:19,780
bog‘liq eski mish-mishlar yana jamoatchilik e’tiboriga qaytdi.

44
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:23,300
Ikkinchi sir: Putindan o‘ttiz yosh kichik ayol.

45
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:25,120
Alina Kabayeva.

46
00:02:25,420 --> 00:02:28,300
Bu ism Rossiyada sport muxlislariga juda yaxshi tanish.

47
00:02:28,380 --> 00:02:30,920
U badiiy gimnastika bo‘yicha Olimpiya chempioni.

48
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:34,560
2004-yilda Afinada oltin medalni qo‘lga kiritgan.

49
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:37,910
Keyinchalik sportni tark etib, siyosat va media sohasida

50
00:02:37,910 --> 00:02:39,280
faoliyat yurita boshlagan.

51
00:02:39,580 --> 00:02:43,560
Ammo uning nomi dunyo matbuotida boshqa sabab bilan ham mashhur bo‘ldi.

52
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:47,500
Uzoq yillardan beri Kabayeva Vladimir Putinning ehtimoliy yaqin

53
00:02:47,500 --> 00:02:49,320
hamrohi sifatida tilga olinadi.

54
00:02:49,620 --> 00:02:52,360
Ularning yosh farqi qariyb o‘ttiz yil.

55
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:57,127
2008-yilda Rossiyadagi bir gazeta Putin Lyudmila bilan ajrashib,

56
00:02:57,127 --> 00:02:59,120
Kabayevaga uylanmoqchi ekanini yozdi.

57
00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:01,600
Bu xabar katta shov-shuvga sabab bo‘ldi.

58
00:03:01,620 --> 00:03:03,400
Ammo Putin xabarni rad etdi.

59
00:03:03,620 --> 00:03:07,300
Kabayeva ham ular o‘rtasida romantik munosabat mavjudligini inkor qilgan.

60
00:03:07,860 --> 00:03:10,984
Shunga qaramay, xalqaro matbuotda bu mavzu yillar davomida

61
00:03:10,984 --> 00:03:11,900
muhokama qilindi.

62
00:03:12,420 --> 00:03:15,726
Kabayeva keyinchalik Rossiyadagi yirik media tuzilmalardan biri

63
00:03:15,726 --> 00:03:18,560
— National Media Group rahbariyatida faoliyat yuritdi.

64
00:03:18,720 --> 00:03:21,781
Shu tariqa sobiq sportchi Rossiyadagi axborot sanoatidagi

65
00:03:21,781 --> 00:03:23,660
nufuzli shaxslardan biriga aylandi.

66
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:27,044
Lekin eng katta shov-shuv uning faoliyati bilan emas, balki

67
00:03:27,044 --> 00:03:29,780
farzandlari haqidagi xabarlar bilan bog‘liq edi.

68
00:03:30,500 --> 00:03:33,180
Uchinchi sir: Putinning yashirin o‘g‘illari bormi?

69
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:36,740
2024-yil sentyabr oyida Dossier Center nomli jurnalistik

70
00:03:36,740 --> 00:03:40,060
surishtiruv tashkiloti yangi ma’lumotlarni e’lon qildi.

71
00:03:40,300 --> 00:03:43,567
Surishtiruvga ko‘ra, Vladimir Putin va Alina Kabayevaning ikki

72
00:03:43,567 --> 00:03:45,200
o‘g‘li borligi taxmin qilinadi.

73
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:49,120
Jurnalistlar ularning ismlarini Ivan va Vladimir deb keltirgan.

74
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:52,303
Shuningdek, bolalar Rossiyadagi qattiq qo‘riqlanadigan

75
00:03:52,303 --> 00:03:53,540
qarorgohlarda yashashi,

76
00:03:53,540 --> 00:03:56,293
ular uchun maxsus o‘qituvchilar va tarbiyachilar yollangani

77
00:03:56,293 --> 00:03:57,880
haqida ma’lumotlar e’lon qilingan.

78
00:03:58,220 --> 00:04:02,202
2026-yil may oyida Radio Free Europe / Radio Liberty tarkibidagi

79
00:04:02,202 --> 00:04:03,820
«Sistema» surishtiruvi ham

80
00:04:04,320 --> 00:04:07,205
bolalarga dars bergani aytilgan xorijlik mutaxassislar va

81
00:04:07,205 --> 00:04:09,280
ularning ishiga oid hujjatlarni o‘rgandi.

82
00:04:09,640 --> 00:04:12,576
Jurnalistlar ingliz va nemis tillarini o‘rgatish uchun xorijlik

83
00:04:12,576 --> 00:04:14,720
tarbiyachilar jalb qilinganini xabar qilishdi.

84
00:04:15,180 --> 00:04:17,780
Ammo bir narsani alohida ta’kidlash kerak.

85
00:04:17,940 --> 00:04:21,183
Putin bu bolalar o‘zining farzandlari ekanini omma oldida

86
00:04:21,183 --> 00:04:21,980
tasdiqlamagan.

87
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:23,520
Demak, bu ma’lumotlar

88
00:04:23,540 --> 00:04:27,113
rasmiy oilaviy fakt emas, balki jurnalistik surishtiruvlarda

89
00:04:27,113 --> 00:04:28,780
ilgari surilgan da’volardir.

90
00:04:29,250 --> 00:04:32,395
Shunday bo‘lsa-da, savol tug‘iladi: nega Rossiya prezidentining

91
00:04:32,395 --> 00:04:35,740
ehtimoliy oilaviy hayoti atrofida bunchalik katta maxfiylik mavjud?

92
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:39,313
Bunga xavfsizlik, shaxsiy daxlsizlik va siyosiy imij kabi

93
00:04:39,313 --> 00:04:41,120
omillar sabab bo‘lishi mumkin.

94
00:04:41,140 --> 00:04:44,060
Ammo aniq sabablari haqida faqat taxmin qilish mumkin.

95
00:04:44,280 --> 00:04:47,300
To‘rtinchi sir: oddiy ayoldan millionergacha.

96
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:51,500
2020-yilda «Proyekt» nomli mustaqil jurnalistik loyiha

97
00:04:51,500 --> 00:04:53,520
yana bir shov-shuvli surishtiruvni e’lon qildi.

98
00:04:53,540 --> 00:04:57,620
Bu safar e’tibor Svetlana Krivonogix ismli ayolga qaratildi.

99
00:04:57,860 --> 00:05:00,617
Jurnalistlarning ma’lumotlariga ko‘ra, u Sankt-Peterburgda

100
00:05:00,617 --> 00:05:01,900
kamtarona sharoitda o‘sgan.

101
00:05:02,080 --> 00:05:05,130
Keyinchalik esa uning nomi qimmatbaho ko‘chmas mulklar, biznes

102
00:05:05,130 --> 00:05:08,081
aktivlari va Rossiyadagi yirik banklardan biri bilan bog‘liq

103
00:05:08,081 --> 00:05:09,360
hujjatlarda paydo bo‘lgan.

104
00:05:09,640 --> 00:05:12,836
«Proyekt» uning oilasi bilan bog‘liq aktivlar qiymatini o‘sha

105
00:05:12,836 --> 00:05:16,660
paytdagi hisob-kitoblar bo‘yicha taxminan 100 million dollarga baholagan.

106
00:05:16,780 --> 00:05:19,280
Lekin jurnalistlarni faqat boylik qiziqtirmagan.

107
00:05:19,420 --> 00:05:22,440
Ular Krivonogixning 2003-yilda tug‘ilgan qizi

108
00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:24,740
Yelizaveta haqida ham ma’lumot e’lon qilgan.

109
00:05:24,900 --> 00:05:27,763
Surishtiruvda Putin uning otasi bo‘lishi mumkinligi haqidagi

110
00:05:27,763 --> 00:05:28,860
taxmin ilgari surilgan.

111
00:05:28,940 --> 00:05:31,760
Biroq bu qarindoshlik mustaqil ravishda isbotlanmagan.

112
00:05:32,020 --> 00:05:34,742
Kreml matbuot kotibi Dmitriy Peskov esa «Proyekt»

113
00:05:34,742 --> 00:05:37,520
surishtiruvidagi da’volarni asossiz deb rad etgan.

114
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:41,520
Bu voqea Rossiyada yana bir katta muhokamani keltirib chiqardi:

115
00:05:41,700 --> 00:05:44,960
qanday qilib prezidentga yaqin ekani taxmin qilinayotgan

116
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:47,580
insonlar ulkan boyliklarga ega bo‘lib qolgan?

117
00:05:47,780 --> 00:05:50,740
Bu savol shunchaki shaxsiy munosabatlar haqida emas.

118
00:05:50,900 --> 00:05:55,032
Bu hokimiyat, moliyaviy aloqalar va manfaatlar to‘qnashuvi

119
00:05:55,032 --> 00:05:56,100
haqida ham edi.

120
00:05:56,180 --> 00:05:59,000
Beshinchi sir: Putinning qizlari kim?

121
00:05:59,420 --> 00:06:02,784
Putinning rasmiy nikohidan tug‘ilgan ikki qizi haqida ham uzoq

122
00:06:02,784 --> 00:06:04,520
vaqt juda kam ma’lumot berilgan.

123
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:08,355
Xalqaro matbuot ularni Mariya Vorontsova va Katerina Tixonova

124
00:06:08,355 --> 00:06:09,680
sifatida tanishtiradi.

125
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:13,760
Mariya tibbiyot va ilmiy faoliyat bilan bog‘liq loyihalarda ishlagan.

126
00:06:13,820 --> 00:06:17,800
Katerina esa ilmiy va texnologik loyihalardagi faoliyati bilan tanilgan.

127
00:06:18,060 --> 00:06:21,760
2022-yilda Amerika Qo‘shma Shtatlari ularning ikkalasiga ham

128
00:06:21,760 --> 00:06:23,240
sanksiyalar joriy qildi.

129
00:06:23,260 --> 00:06:27,520
Shundan keyin Putin oilasi haqidagi xalqaro qiziqish yanada kuchaydi.

130
00:06:27,740 --> 00:06:31,027
Lekin Putin farzandlari haqida gapirishda doimo ehtiyotkor

131
00:06:31,027 --> 00:06:31,820
bo‘lib kelgan.

132
00:06:31,940 --> 00:06:35,507
Ularning shaxsiy hayoti, oilaviy munosabatlari va kundalik

133
00:06:35,507 --> 00:06:38,520
faoliyati ommaga juda cheklangan darajada ma’lum.

134
00:06:38,580 --> 00:06:41,760
Eng katta savol: nega bunchalik maxfiylik?

135
00:06:41,940 --> 00:06:43,220
Endi tasavvur qiling.

136
00:06:43,340 --> 00:06:46,820
Bir tomonda dunyoning eng qudratli siyosiy rahbarlaridan biri.

137
00:06:46,900 --> 00:06:50,459
Uning uchrashuvlari, harbiy qarorlari va xalqaro bayonotlari

138
00:06:50,459 --> 00:06:52,060
doimiy ravishda kuzatiladi.

139
00:06:52,140 --> 00:06:55,413
Ikkinchi tomonda esa uning oilasi haqida bir-biriga zid

140
00:06:55,413 --> 00:06:59,460
ma’lumotlar, jurnalistik surishtiruvlar va javobsiz savollar mavjud.

141
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:02,340
Bu ikki dunyo o‘rtasida katta farq bor.

142
00:07:02,540 --> 00:07:05,320
Putinning siyosiy hayoti ko‘pchilikning ko‘z o‘ngida.

143
00:07:05,500 --> 00:07:08,060
Shaxsiy hayoti esa ko‘pchilikdan yopiq.

144
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:12,137
Albatta, har bir inson, hatto davlat rahbari ham shaxsiy hayot

145
00:07:12,137 --> 00:07:13,660
daxlsizligi huquqiga ega.

146
00:07:13,840 --> 00:07:17,654
Ammo siyosiy rahbarlarning yaqinlari katta moliyaviy aktivlar,

147
00:07:17,654 --> 00:07:19,500
davlat bilan bog‘liq loyihalar

148
00:07:19,580 --> 00:07:22,729
yoki nufuzli bizneslar bilan aloqador bo‘lsa, bu masalalar

149
00:07:22,729 --> 00:07:25,660
jamoatchilik manfaatiga ham taalluqli bo‘lishi mumkin.

150
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:29,473
Shu sababli mustaqil jurnalistlar prezidentlarning moliyaviy va

151
00:07:29,473 --> 00:07:31,300
oilaviy aloqalarini tekshiradi.

152
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:35,900
Lekin surishtiruv bilan isbotlangan fakt bir xil tushuncha emas.

153
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:40,246
Hujjatlar, guvohliklar va moliyaviy ma’lumotlar muhim dalillar

154
00:07:40,246 --> 00:07:41,300
bo‘lishi mumkin.

155
00:07:41,420 --> 00:07:45,458
Shu bilan birga, qarindoshlik yoki romantik munosabat haqidagi

156
00:07:45,458 --> 00:07:46,500
har bir taxminni

157
00:07:46,500 --> 00:07:48,580
haqiqat sifatida taqdim etish mumkin emas.

158
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:52,186
Va mana shu jihat Putinning shaxsiy hayoti haqidagi eng katta

159
00:07:52,186 --> 00:07:54,140
muammolardan biri bo‘lib qolmoqda.

160
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:59,280
Ko‘plab savollar bor, lekin ularning hammasiga ham aniq javob mavjud emas.

161
00:07:59,480 --> 00:08:04,920
Bugun biz Putin va Lyudmilaning o‘ttiz yillik nikohi, ularning ajrashuvi,

162
00:08:05,220 --> 00:08:09,900
Alina Kabayeva bilan bog‘liq xabarlar, ehtimoliy yashirin farzandlar

163
00:08:10,020 --> 00:08:13,540
va Svetlana Krivonogix haqidagi jurnalistik surishtiruvlarni

164
00:08:13,540 --> 00:08:14,420
ko‘rib chiqdik.

165
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:18,140
Bu ma’lumotlarning ayrimlari rasmiy hujjatlar bilan tasdiqlangan,

166
00:08:18,280 --> 00:08:21,700
ayrimlari mustaqil jurnalistlarning surishtiruvlariga asoslangan,

167
00:08:21,820 --> 00:08:25,580
boshqalari esa hozircha tasdiqlanmagan da’volar bo‘lib qolmoqda.

168
00:08:25,700 --> 00:08:27,680
Ammo bitta narsa aniq:

169
00:08:28,020 --> 00:08:31,521
Vladimir Putinning shaxsiy hayoti uning siyosiy faoliyatiga

170
00:08:31,521 --> 00:08:33,360
qaraganda ancha kam yoritilgan.

171
00:08:33,460 --> 00:08:36,846
Va bu holat dunyo matbuotining e’tiborini bundan keyin ham

172
00:08:36,846 --> 00:08:37,780
tortishi mumkin.

173
00:08:38,340 --> 00:08:42,023
Sizningcha, davlat rahbarining shaxsiy hayoti qanchalik oshkora

174
00:08:42,023 --> 00:08:42,900
bo‘lishi kerak?

175
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:46,897
Uning oilasi haqida ma’lumot olish jamoatchilik haqimi yoki bu

176
00:08:46,897 --> 00:08:49,160
shaxsiy hayot chegarasidan o‘tishmi?

177
00:08:50,180 --> 00:08:51,480
Fikringizni izohlarda yozib qoldiring.

178
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:55,757
Chunki ba’zan tarixdagi eng katta savollar davlat rahbarining

179
00:08:55,757 --> 00:08:57,340
rasmiy nutqlarida emas,

180
00:08:57,400 --> 00:09:00,480
ular javob bermagan savollarda yashiringan bo‘ladi.

